        "subject": "LU-20438 lnd: Add lnd_get_device callback for LND modules",
        "message": "LU-20438 lnd: Add lnd_get_device callback for LND modules\n\nIntroduces LND abstraction `lnd_get_device` callback allowing core LNet\nto transparently probe the underlying hardware device (e.g., struct device,\npci_dev) backing an active network interface, completely isolating\nhardware topology logic from upper layers.\n\nChange-Id: I47127adc34b574422824ef39d5fb989f8793bab8\nSigned-off-by: Shivaji Kant <shivajikant@google.com>\n"
      },
      "branch": "refs/heads/master"
    }
